<front> <titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Homers Odu&#x0364;ßee</hi></hi></hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#g">u&#x0364;ber&#x017F;ezt<lb/>
von</hi></hi><lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#g">Johann Heinrich Voß</hi>.</hi></docAuthor></byline><lb/>
